# 0.1.19: Aridia's liquid grid (the sand sea, the brown channel by the landing pad) with the head turned from the game's
# camera, which faces his body's way, not the head's (the owner's 0.1.18 video: the channel's surface ended in straight
# edges, the bed beyond it bare). Put at the start facing away from the channel (QUEST_SIM_AT=210.41,170.35,25.34,-48):
